{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>The Internet is on Trial, and You're the Judge.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Investigate Petty Drama With Unique Tools at your Disposal.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/newnewSteamGif2.gif?t=1744302396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Review &quot;Am I The Asshole&quot; Posts, Snoop through phones &amp; text messages, Interrogate suspects and witnesses, Judge YTA (You're The Asshole) or NTA (Not The Asshole).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>A Fully Functioning Crypto Market Simulator.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/stockvalue2.gif?t=1744302396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy and sell different stocks/crypto. Try to time the market to make a profit or else be the loser left holding the bag.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Jury Twitch Chat Integration.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/newSteamGiff.gif?t=1744302396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grill twitch chat like a courtroom jury. Poll them on YTA or NTA and let democracy do its worst.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Decorate Your Room.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/newROOM_SCENE_2.gif?t=1744302396\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your space with posters, desks, figurines, chairs, and more. Build your aesthetic: Cluttercore, Minimalism, Gooner Cave\u2014whatever lets you cope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634760?t=1744302396","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/eba6d4fc88b60ddb9a077c48fc1606a5cf81d9db/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744302396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/5511f80fcc13dd071a6e90f8f4d2f61999340148/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744302396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/5511f80fcc13dd071a6e90f8f4d2f61999340148/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744302396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"dudes talk about smoking weed and other drugs sometimes ya dig"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>The Internet is on Trial, and You're the Judge.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Investigate Petty Drama With Unique Tools at your Disposal.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/newnewSteamGif2.gif?t=1744302396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Review &quot;Am I The Asshole&quot; Posts, Snoop through phones &amp; text messages, Interrogate suspects and witnesses, Judge YTA (You're The Asshole) or NTA (Not The Asshole).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>A Fully Functioning Crypto Market Simulator.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/stockvalue2.gif?t=1744302396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy and sell different stocks/crypto. Try to time the market to make a profit or else be the loser left holding the bag.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Jury Twitch Chat Integration.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/newSteamGiff.gif?t=1744302396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grill twitch chat like a courtroom jury. Poll them on YTA or NTA and let democracy do its worst.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Decorate Your Room.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/newROOM_SCENE_2.gif?t=1744302396\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your space with posters, desks, figurines, chairs, and more. Build your aesthetic: Cluttercore, Minimalism, Gooner Cave\u2014whatever lets you cope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Toby Wright"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/96f60045724aae7cc8cb3386b18170397ae0f2b9/header.jpg?t=1744302396","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120786,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120786/movie480.mp4?t=1744256087","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120786/movie_max.mp4?t=1744256087"},"name":"Am I The Asshole Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120786/be27f7769c4492016a92dc62dcbca37c1184eeab/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744256087","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120786/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744256087","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120786/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744256087"}}],"name":"Am I